{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Groningen in Oorlogstijd, interview 11"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41848"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Oorlogs- en Verzetscentrum Groningen (OVCG)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.J.  Jongejan"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ovcg"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De heer Harry Oostland heeft de oorlog meegemaakt als kind in het dorp Midwolda (Oldambt). Hij kwam uit een hervormd gezin. Zijn vader, horlogemaker van beroep werd opgepakt omdat hij illegale kranten rondbracht. Hij wist echter te ontsnappen en is in het donker door de regen gevlucht. Hij dook onder bij een buurman. Oostland vertelt verder over de Sinterklaasviering van 1944, waarbij hij cadeau's kreeg die waren vervaardigd door onderduikers uit de buurt. Ook vertelt hij over de dood van zijn moeder in december 1945 en over de dubbelrol van Udo Andries van Bergen. Midwolda werd bevrijd door de Polen, van wie Oostland chocola kreeg.<br><br>00:12:30: NSB'ers kwamen om zijn vader te arresteren. Hij wist echter te ontsnappen en bracht de nacht door in het kippenhok van schilder Prak.<br><br>00:22:10: Udo Andries van Bergen, (speelde dubbelrol) schudde Oostland door elkaar om de verblijfplaats van zijn vader te weten te komen. Dit was een hint, waardoor vader Oostland naar een ander onderduikadres vertrok.<br><br>00:27:04: Sinterklaasspektakel<br><br>00:29:50: Moeder overleed in december 1945 aan difterie<br><br>00:30:30: Bouw van een drijvend bordeel in Midwolda en omstreken.<br><br>00:35:10: Hongerkinderen uit het westen<br><br>00:39:20: Bevrijding door Polen<br><br>00:49:00: Bekijken van foto's<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-06-23"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>N.B.: De opmerking, gemaakt in het interview (tussen de tijdstippen 00:30:00 en 00:35:00) dat Meinto Edens niet koosjer gehandeld zou hebben met declaraties is volgens documentatie van de Politieke Opsporings Dienst niet juist.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Midwolda"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oostwold"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Winschoten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NSB"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arrestatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hovinga"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"hoefsmid Breuker"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schilder Prak"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Udo Andries van Bergen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Meinto Edens"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wiegert Baas"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Duitsers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bevrijding"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Polen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fienie Klaassen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"onderduikers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"hongerkinderen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-11-25"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Drs. Monique Brinks (interviewster)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-10-22"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-10-22"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHol